# Desktop: the cpArrow spinners (port only: the reference rig types keys and cannot click).
# Delay up twice (4), Spacing down (74), Granularity up (1), Border down (2); "x" in Border then up
# resets it to 1 (invalid text: the field's value for code 4); Granularity 99 fails OK's check with
# message 208; 1 and OK. WIN.INI after: ScreenSaveTimeOut=240, IconSpacing=74, GridGranularity=1,
# BorderWidth=1. UNTESTED against real 3.11 (no mouse in the rig); the arrow positions are the port's.
# Run: ARCH311_REF=<rig> ARCH311_REF_INI=1 tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/desktop-arrows.w16 OUT Desktop
sleep 600
shot shots/01-desktop.png
click 169 216
sleep 100
click 169 216
sleep 100
click 307 272
sleep 100
click 174 332
sleep 100
click 174 365
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/02-arrows.png
type x
click 174 355
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/03-reset.png
key shift+tab
type 99
key enter
sleep 500
shot shots/04-message.png
key enter
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/05-back.png
type 1
key enter
sleep 800
shot shots/06-ok.png
quit
